-- **Inputs**: Scene parameters $\pi$; integrand $f(\omega, \pi)$ defined over a domain (e.g., unit sphere $S^2$ or path space); sampling distribution $p(\omega)$.
-- **Outputs**: Gradient estimate $\nabla_\pi I(\pi)$.
